{"id":"e376b5c876ef4c86","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-ordered-dnf.md","title":"有序析取范式及其限制","display":"df-ordered-dnf — 有序析取范式及其限制","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-ordered-dnf","aliases":["29-df-ordered-dnf"],"display":"df-ordered-dnf — 有序析取范式及其限制","depends_on":["[[29-df-boolean-restriction]]"],"source_locator":"Section13.1, p.204, DjVu scan219, canonical decision tree definition and footnote1","source_basis":"扫描219原图；有限部分赋值与项序列是本地显式编码。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-ordered-dnf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-ordered-dnf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordered-dnf — 有序析取范式及其限制"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e25523dc1eeba65a\" href=\"?note=e25523dc1eeba65a\" title=\"29-df-boolean-restriction\">29-df-boolean-restriction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Section13.1, p.204, DjVu scan219, canonical decision tree definition and footnote1"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"扫描219原图；有限部分赋值与项序列是本地显式编码。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B,V_n,\\mathcal R_n,U_n(\\rho)\">\\(\\mathbb B,V_n,\\mathcal R_n,U_n(\\rho)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e25523dc1eeba65a\" href=\"?note=e25523dc1eeba65a\" title=\"29-df-boolean-restriction\">29-df-boolean-restriction</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal R_n\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal R_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{J\\subseteq V_n}\\mathbb B^J\">\\(\\bigcup_{J\\subseteq V_n}\\mathbb B^J\\)</span> 中取值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是此集合中元素组成的有限序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\)</span> 为空序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 为序列串接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_j\">\\(F_j\\)</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 项。函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 编码正文字，值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 编码负文字；每个变量在一个项中至多出现一次。</li>\n<li>下式定义语法集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_n,\\mathsf{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_n,\\mathsf{DNF}_n\\)</span>、真值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_n(F,x)\\in\\mathbb B\">\\(b_n(F,x)\\in\\mathbb B\\)</span>、宽度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_n(F)\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(w_n(F)\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 和限制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_n:\\mathsf{DNF}_n\\times\\mathcal R_n\\to\\mathsf{DNF}_n\">\\(R_n:\\mathsf{DNF}_n\\times\\mathcal R_n\\to\\mathsf{DNF}_n\\)</span>。空积为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{J\\subseteq V_n}\\mathbb B^J,\\qquad\\mathsf{DNF}_n\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Term}_n^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Term}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{J\\subseteq V_n}\\mathbb B^J,\\qquad\\mathsf{DNF}_n\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Term}_n^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_n(F,x)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\prod_{i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(F_j)}(1-|x(i)-F_j(i)|)\\;\\middle|\\;1\\leq j\\leq|F|\\right\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_n(F,x)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\prod_{i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(F_j)}(1-|x(i)-F_j(i)|)\\;\\middle|\\;1\\leq j\\leq|F|\\right\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w_n(F)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\operatorname{dom}(F_j)|\\mid1\\leq j\\leq|F|\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w_n(F)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\operatorname{dom}(F_j)|\\mid1\\leq j\\leq|F|\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_n(\\langle\\rangle,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_n(\\langle\\rangle,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_n(\\langle C\\rangle\\frown F,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}R_n(F,\\rho),&amp;\\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(C)\\setminus U_n(\\rho)\\;(C(i)\\ne\\rho(i)),\\\\\\langle C\\!\\upharpoonright\\!U_n(\\rho)\\rangle\\frown R_n(F,\\rho),&amp;\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(C)\\setminus U_n(\\rho)\\;(C(i)=\\rho(i)).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_n(\\langle C\\rangle\\frown F,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}R_n(F,\\rho),&amp;\\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(C)\\setminus U_n(\\rho)\\;(C(i)\\ne\\rho(i)),\\\\\\langle C\\!\\upharpoonright\\!U_n(\\rho)\\rangle\\frown R_n(F,\\rho),&amp;\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(C)\\setminus U_n(\\rho)\\;(C(i)=\\rho(i)).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 断言其定义域内各变量都取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 指定的值；整列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是按顺序列出的这些项的析取。真值函数的空积处理空项，而外层的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0\\}\">\\(\\{0\\}\\)</span> 处理空析取：空序列恒假，含有空项的序列恒真。不同的项序列可以表示同一布尔函数，但本章的典范决策树依赖保留的项序。</p>\n<p>原书对一个项有唯一满足赋值的写法隐含排除了相互矛盾的文字。本编码只允许相容的部分赋值；一般 DNF 可先删除矛盾项、合并项内重复文字，并保留其余项的顺序，得到相同布尔函数，宽度不增。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_n\">\\(R_n\\)</span> 删除已经被固定值否定的项，再从保留项中删除已经满足的文字；它不重排项，也不凭语义恒真性提前删去后续项。递归每次缩短序列，分支互斥且穷尽，故总函数良定义。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathbb B^{U_n(\\rho)}\">\\(y\\in\\mathbb B^{U_n(\\rho)}\\)</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 任意扩张为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}\\)</span>，都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_n(R_n(F,\\rho),x)=b_n(F,\\operatorname{Ext}_n(\\rho,y))\">\\(b_n(R_n(F,\\rho),x)=b_n(F,\\operatorname{Ext}_n(\\rho,y))\\)</span>；逐项比较乘积即可验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-boolean-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"e25523dc1eeba65a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-boolean-restriction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-boolean-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"e25523dc1eeba65a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathbb B,V_n,\\mathcal R_n,U_n(\\rho)$ 见 [[29-df-boolean-restriction]]。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal R_n$，$x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B,V_n,\\mathcal R_n,U_n(\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathcal R_n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup_{J\\subseteq V_n}\\mathbb B^J","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"F_j","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Term}_n,\\mathsf{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"b_n(F,x)\\in\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"w_n(F)\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R_n:\\mathsf{DNF}_n\\times\\mathcal R_n\\to\\mathsf{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Term}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{J\\subseteq V_n}\\mathbb B^J,\\qquad\\mathsf{DNF}_n\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Term}_n^{<\\omega}.","display":true},{"tex":"b_n(F,x)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\prod_{i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(F_j)}(1-|x(i)-F_j(i)|)\\;\\middle|\\;1\\leq j\\leq|F|\\right\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"w_n(F)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\operatorname{dom}(F_j)|\\mid1\\leq j\\leq|F|\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"R_n(\\langle\\rangle,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"R_n(\\langle C\\rangle\\frown F,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}R_n(F,\\rho),&\\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(C)\\setminus U_n(\\rho)\\;(C(i)\\ne\\rho(i)),\\\\\\langle C\\!\\upharpoonright\\!U_n(\\rho)\\rangle\\frown R_n(F,\\rho),&\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(C)\\setminus U_n(\\rho)\\;(C(i)=\\rho(i)).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R_n","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\mathbb B^{U_n(\\rho)}","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}","display":false},{"tex":"b_n(R_n(F,\\rho),x)=b_n(F,\\operatorname{Ext}_n(\\rho,y))","display":false}],"bytes":2952,"backlinks":[{"id":"d96a123476b0bcd3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathsf{DNF}_n,\\mathsf{Term}_n,R_n,b_n$ 见 [[29-df-ordered-dnf]]；$V_n,\\mathbb B,\\widehat a_n$ 见 [[29-df-boolean-restriction]]。$F\\in\\mathsf{DNF}_n$，$C\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n$，$x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}$。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-boolean-restriction]]、[[29-df-canonical-decision-tree]]、[[29-df-ordered-dnf]]、[[29-lem-hastad-switching]]、[[29-thm-parity-ac0]] — 随机限制、DNF 规范树、切换引理及非一致 AC⁰ 奇偶性下界"},{"id":"d7ed38c661c35e87","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F\\in\\mathsf{DNF}_n$ 且 $w_n(F)\\leq k$，其语法、项序和限制 $R_n(F,\\rho)$ 见 [[29-df-ordered-dnf]]。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ordered-dnf]]"}],"outgoing":["e25523dc1eeba65a"]}